# Strict ingest judges and admits an entry although its catalog, policy or
# dead-letter collaborator failed.
MODULE: NothingAdmittedWhileUnavailableTrustsFailedLookup
TARGET: NothingAdmittedWhileUnavailable
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a failed collaborator does not fail the write
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       THEN IF up["Deps"]
--- REPLACE
       THEN IF TRUE
--- END
